-- Verify to_number, which ty reads (ty_num_from_char): PostgreSQL's own cases,
-- and round trips of numbers through to_char by number formats, as they
-- are and perturbed. digres makes the decimal of ty's digits. A refusal is
-- what is tested, so an error goes on to the next statement.
\set ON_ERROR_STOP off
